Object.assign(stories[2],{title:'Boyfriend for the Wedding',genre:'Fake Dating · Second Chance',length:'11 scenes · 3 endings',hook:'Your ex is marrying in Jeju. Your actor client becomes your fake boyfriend—just before your first love returns as best man.',tags:['fake dating','only one room','first love'],cast:[['V','BTS','Your actor fake boyfriend','Artful, attentive, and far too convincing.'],['Felix','Stray Kids','Your first love and the best man','Warm, sincere, and carrying an unopened goodbye.'],['Yunjin','LE SSERAFIM','Your manager and co-conspirator','Bold enough to write the fake-dating contract herself.'],['Kazuha','LE SSERAFIM','The bride’s observant cousin','Elegant, calm, and impossible to fool.'],['Hanni','NewJeans','Your younger sister','Keeper of your history and honest advice.']],setup:{kicker:'FAKE BOYFRIEND. REAL FIRST LOVE. ONE HOTEL ROOM.',title:'Boyfriend for the Wedding',body:'Your ex invites you to his luxury Jeju wedding with a handwritten note: “I hope you found someone too.” You have not. Your actor client V volunteers to play the perfect boyfriend for one weekend. The plan survives exactly until the best man turns around—and you recognize Felix, the first love who disappeared without saying goodbye.',stakes:'Rehearse a believable romance, face the goodbye you never received, and decide whether your future belongs with the man beside you now or the one who came back.',warning:'A fictional fake-dating romantic comedy. Everyone is an adult.'},start:'w0',nodes:{
 w0:{chapter:'CHAPTER 1 · THE INVITATION',place:'YOUR AGENCY · MONDAY, 6:40 PM',who:'Yunjin',transition:'A cream wedding invitation arrives during the final meeting of the day.',context:'Your ex’s handwritten note—“I hope you found someone too”—turns an invitation into a challenge. Yunjin calls it emotional terrorism. V, your actor client, overhears and offers to become the date nobody will question.',text:'Three days. I hold your hand, look devastated by your beauty, and make your ex regret having eyes. Strictly professional.',choices:[['Accept and let Yunjin write strict rules.','w1',{v:2},'Rule five: no real feelings.'],['Accept, but insist the performance stays subtle.','w1',{v:1,trust:1},'V promises restraint with an unconvincing smile.'],['Refuse until your ex sends a pitying follow-up text.','w1',{bold:2,v:1},'Spite signs the contract for you.']]},
 w1:{chapter:'CHAPTER 1 · REHEARSAL',place:'EMPTY PHOTO STUDIO · WEDNESDAY, 8:15 PM',who:'V',transition:'Two evenings later, Yunjin schedules a fake-date rehearsal after V’s campaign shoot.',context:'You practice the story of how you met, your imaginary first date, and the pet name he supposedly uses. V learns your coffee order in one try and notices you touch your necklace whenever you lie.',text:'The problem is not making people believe I like you. The problem is remembering I am supposed to pretend.',choices:[['Practice holding hands until it feels natural.','w2',{v:3},'His thumb traces yours long after Yunjin calls cut.'],['Invent an embarrassing first-date story together.','w2',{v:2,trust:2},'Shared laughter makes the lie feel lived-in.'],['Practice a convincing almost-kiss.','w2',{v:4,bold:1},'Neither of you remembers who steps closer first.']]},
 w2:{chapter:'CHAPTER 2 · THE FLIGHT',place:'SEOUL TO JEJU · FRIDAY, 11:20 AM',who:'V',transition:'Friday morning, the fake couple boards a flight beneath hats and matching sunglasses.',context:'V gives you the window seat and offers one earbud. Halfway to Jeju, he asks what happened with your first love—the person Hanni mentioned while helping you pack. You have never told him about Felix.',text:'I can play your boyfriend better if I know which ghosts might appear at the wedding.',choices:[['Tell him Felix left without saying goodbye.','w3',{v:1,trust:3},'V listens without trying to solve the hurt.'],['Say the past no longer matters.','w3',{secret:2},'He accepts the boundary but knows it is not true.'],['Ask why he really volunteered.','w3',{v:3},'He says actors are allowed one secret until the final act.']]},
 w3:{chapter:'CHAPTER 2 · THE BEST MAN',place:'JEJU SEASIDE RESORT · 3:10 PM',who:'Felix',transition:'At the resort, V takes your hand before the car door opens and the performance begins.',context:'Your ex looks appropriately stunned. Guests whisper about V. Then the best man turns around. Felix is older, still warm, and visibly unprepared to see another man’s fingers linked with yours.',text:'You look happy. I wanted to apologize before the wedding. I just did not know you were bringing him.',choices:[['Introduce V as your boyfriend and lean into him.','w4',{v:3,felix:1},'V plays the role; Felix hides the reaction.'],['Ask Felix to meet you later at the lighthouse.','w4',{felix:3},'You open the door to the missing goodbye.'],['Tell Felix this is not the place for apologies.','w4',{self:2,felix:1},'He accepts the boundary and gives you space.']]},
 w4:{chapter:'CHAPTER 2 · ONLY ONE ROOM',place:'HONEYMOON SUITE · 5:45 PM',who:'V',transition:'The hotel loses one reservation. The only remaining room has one bed and rose petals spelling FOREVER.',context:'V offers to sleep on a sofa approximately four feet long. While you remove the petals, Felix texts the lighthouse location. V sees his name light the screen but waits for you to explain.',text:'Rule two says we do not lie when we are alone. Are you going to meet him—and am I only pretending to be jealous?',choices:[['Stay and admit the jealousy looks real.','w5',{v:4},'The hotel room becomes more dangerous than the lighthouse.'],['Go hear Felix’s explanation.','w5',{felix:4},'V lets you go, but asks you to come back.'],['Tell V everything before deciding.','w5',{v:2,trust:3},'Honesty makes the room feel intimate.']]},
 w5:{chapter:'CHAPTER 2 · THE UNOPENED LETTER',place:'JEJU LIGHTHOUSE · 7:02 PM',who:'Felix',transition:'Whether you planned to meet him or not, Felix finds you outside before the rehearsal dinner and asks for five honest minutes.',context:'He gives you a sealed letter dated the week he left. His family moved suddenly; every message he drafted sounded too small, then shame made silence easier. He does not ask forgiveness—only that you know the disappearance was never indifference.',text:'I thought staying away would hurt you less than returning late. Seeing you now makes that sound as foolish as it was.',choices:[['Read the letter beside him.','w6',{felix:4,trust:1},'The first love becomes real again, not merely nostalgic.'],['Keep the letter closed until after the wedding.','w6',{felix:2,self:1},'You control when the past gets access to you.'],['Tell him V may no longer be entirely fake.','w6',{v:2,felix:1},'Felix is hurt, but grateful for the truth.']]},
 w6:{chapter:'CHAPTER 3 · REHEARSAL DINNER',place:'CLIFFSIDE TERRACE · 8:30 PM',who:'Hanni',transition:'You return from the lighthouse as dinner begins. Hanni reads your expression before you sit down.',context:'V performs the attentive boyfriend perfectly, but his concern is no longer acting. Felix plays the song you loved at nineteen. Your ex announces a couples’ dance, clearly hoping the fake relationship will crack.',text:'One man knows who you became. One remembers who you were. Stop asking which story photographs better. Ask where you can breathe.',choices:[['Dance with V and forget the audience.','w7',{v:4},'He misses the cue because he is looking at you.'],['Ask Felix for the dance you never had.','w7',{felix:4},'His hand finds yours like no time passed.'],['Dance with Hanni and reject the test.','w7',{self:3},'Your sister rescues the moment with terrible choreography.']]},
 w7:{chapter:'CHAPTER 3 · THE EX',place:'TERRACE CORRIDOR · 9:18 PM',who:'Your ex',transition:'After the dance, your ex follows you into the corridor and asks whether the relationship with V is real.',context:'He claims the invitation was meant kindly, then admits he wanted proof you had moved on. V and Felix both notice the conversation from opposite ends of the terrace, but neither interrupts without your signal.',text:'You never looked at me the way you looked at them tonight. Which one is real?',choices:[['Say your life is no longer his business.','w8',{self:3},'Both men respect that you rescue yourself.'],['Take V’s hand and call the relationship real.','w8',{v:4},'The lie changes shape the moment you say it.'],['Ask Felix to walk you away.','w8',{felix:4},'You choose the person tied to the truth your ex never knew.']]},
 w8:{chapter:'CHAPTER 4 · THE RAIN SCENE',place:'JEJU LIGHTHOUSE · 11:52 PM',who:'Your strongest connection',transition:'A coastal storm ends the dinner. You escape to the lighthouse, and the person your choices pulled closest follows with an umbrella.',context:'There is no audience, ex, or performance here. Only rain, the ocean, and a man who wants to know whether tonight changed anything.',text:'Tell me one true thing. Was any part of this weekend real?',routeByTopWedding:true,choices:[['Kiss him in the rain.','w9',{heart:4},'The cliché is perfect for a reason.'],['Tell him the truth before touching him.','w9',{trust:4},'You choose confession over performance.'],['Ask for the night to think.','w9',{self:2},'He gives you space without withdrawing his feelings.']]},
 w9:{chapter:'CHAPTER 4 · THE MORNING AFTER',place:'HONEYMOON SUITE BALCONY · 8:05 AM',who:'You',transition:'Morning arrives bright and quiet after the storm.',context:'V’s contract lies on the table with his signature crossed out. Felix’s letter rests beside it, opened or unopened according to your choice. Hanni brings coffee and refuses to let you hide behind wedding logistics.',text:'Today is somebody else’s ceremony. That does not mean you owe anybody your own romantic ending before you are ready.',choices:[['Decide to choose the strongest connection.','w10',{love:3},'You are ready to ask for something real.'],['Choose yourself and make both men court you properly.','w10',{self:5},'No more convenient timing or borrowed roles.'],['Decide the fake relationship with V deserves a real chance.','w10',{v:4},'You choose the person who stayed in the present.']]},
 w10:{chapter:'FINALE · THE WEDDING',place:'GLASS CHAPEL · 4:00 PM',who:'Kazuha',transition:'The ceremony begins beneath clear skies. Kazuha finds you outside holding both the contract and the letter.',context:'V waits near the gardens without performing. Felix waits near the ocean without asking you to rewrite the past. For once, both men leave the decision entirely with you.',text:'Everybody is watching the bride. Your ending can happen quietly.',routeByTopWedding:true,choices:[['Find the man your heart kept choosing.','wend',{love:5},'You choose the relationship your actions built.'],['Leave with Hanni and choose yourself.','wend',{self:5,solo:1},'Both men will have to meet you on your timeline.'],['Tear up the contract and choose V.','wend',{v:5,chooseV:1},'The fake boyfriend receives one unscripted chance.']]}
}});

