 bar_arrive:{chapter:'CHAPTER 3 · THE BAR',place:'VELVET ROOM BAR · 10:45 PM',who:'Narrator',transition:'After karaoke, the company outing moves to a candlelit bar around the corner.',context:'You dance with Jennie and Rosé until your throat hurts from laughing. When the music slows, you head toward the bar for water—and find Mingyu already ordering your usual drink.',text:'He slides the glass toward you and claims it is simply his responsibility as your superior to make sure you are having a good time.',type:'interlude',choices:[['Go to the bar and join Mingyu.','m0',{},'A quiet drink becomes a much closer interaction.']]},
 bathroom_arrive:{chapter:'CHAPTER 3 · A QUICK TOUCH-UP',place:'HALLWAY TO THE RESTROOMS · 11:08 PM',who:'Narrator',transition:'After the moment with Mingyu, you excuse yourself to clean the last drops from your sleeve and touch up your makeup.',context:'The hallway is cooler and quieter than the bar. As you pass the service exit, the door opens and you nearly walk straight into Jungkook.',text:'He takes one look at Mingyu’s jacket around your shoulders, then glances toward the alley where his motorcycle is parked.',type:'interlude',choices:[['Stop and ask Jungkook what he is doing outside.','j0',{},'He has been hoping for five minutes alone with you.']]},
 dance_arrive:{chapter:'CHAPTER 3 · BACK TO THE PARTY',place:'VELVET ROOM BAR · 11:34 PM',who:'Jennie',transition:'After your private moment with Jungkook, you return inside to finish the drink waiting at the bar.',context:'Jennie and Rosé pull you between them, demand every detail, and toast to “terrible decisions made in excellent outfits.” When a dance track begins, Rosé takes your glass and Jennie pushes you toward the floor.',text:'Go dance. And if you happen to fall into somebody handsome, at least make it look intentional.',choices:[['Finish your drink and join the dance floor.','s0x',{friend:1},'The room spins pleasantly—and San is closer than you realized.']]},
 steal_jk:{chapter:'CHAPTER 4 · AN INTERRUPTION',place:'OUTSIDE VELVET ROOM · 12:26 AM',who:'Jungkook',transition:'You choose your ride—but the night has been keeping its own score.',context:'Before your chosen escort can reach you, a manager calls him back inside to handle a missing company card. Jungkook has already collected your coat. He steps forward quietly and says he will take you home instead.',text:'The taxi ride is warm and hushed. He gives you the window seat, tucks his scarf around you, and holds your hand beneath it where nobody can see. He asks the driver to take the long route so you can rest against his shoulder a little longer.',choices:[['Let Jungkook take you the rest of the way home.','h_jk',{jk:1},'The man who fell hardest gets his chance.']]},
 steal_san:{chapter:'CHAPTER 4 · AN INTERRUPTION',place:'OUTSIDE VELVET ROOM · 12:26 AM',who:'San',transition:'You choose your ride—but the night has been keeping its own score.',context:'Before your chosen escort can reach you, a manager calls him back inside to handle a missing company card. San is waiting beneath one umbrella. He offers his arm and says he will take you home instead.',text:'He buys hot fish cakes for the walk, keeps you on the dry side of the pavement, and turns every crosswalk into an excuse for a tiny dance. When the rain grows heavier, he pulls you against his chest and admits he hoped the night would end this way.',choices:[['Let San walk you the rest of the way home.','h_san',{san:1},'The man who fell hardest gets his chance.']]},
 steal_mingyu:{chapter:'CHAPTER 4 · AN INTERRUPTION',place:'OUTSIDE VELVET ROOM · 12:26 AM',who:'Mingyu',transition:'You choose your ride—but the night has been keeping its own score.',context:'Before your chosen escort can reach you, a manager calls him back inside to handle a missing company card. Mingyu is already holding the car door open. His serious expression softens when he asks you to trust him with the ride home.',text:'He turns the seat warmer on, passes you water, and lowers the music when your head rests against the window. At every red light he checks that you are comfortable. By the time you arrive, your shoes are in his hand and his jacket is still around your shoulders.',choices:[['Let Mingyu walk you to your apartment.','h_mingyu',{mingyu:1},'The man who fell hardest gets his chance.']]}
